SUMMARY:Vespers at the Urban Well
DESCRIPTION:Vespers\,  Sunday evenings at 5:00 PM | In person only\nA contemplative candlelit service to nurture mind\, body and spirit \nJoin us Sunday evenings for Vespers\, a warm and inviting weekly gathering in the serene surroundings of the Saint James Chapel. This quiet\, reflective service embraces Christianity’s rich prayer traditions and the embodied practices that nurture our spiritual lives today. \nGather with us for uplifting singing\, find solace in moments of silence\, and choose the posture that feels most comfortable as we open our hearts to listen for God’s voice and center ourselves for the week ahead. We have meditation cushions and chairs available for your comfort. We’ll celebrate Holy Communion on the third Sunday of the month. In person only. Everyone is welcome—come as you are!
URL:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/event/sunday-evening-vespers-3/2026-11-08/
LOCATION:Saint James Episcopal Church\, 103 North Duke Street\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.saintjameslancaster.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/FEATURED-image-Vespers-2-copy.jpg
GEO:40.040058;-76.30344
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Saint James Episcopal Church 103 North Duke Street Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=103 North Duke Street:geo:-76.30344,40.040058
END:VEVENT
